                      "lineHeight": 1.15
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "fb-61",
                    "type": "text",
                    "data": {
                      "html": "<p>Press damp compost into cubes and sow straight into them. Roots stop at the air gap instead of circling, and the block goes into the ground whole.</p><p><a href=\"https://fieldbook.example/soil-blocker\">The 4-cell blocker, £34</a></p>",
                      "variables": []
